WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.248
"Help me with this fort, Squirrel," said Kip.

2
00:00:07.249 --> 00:00:10.407
"Then we'll be safe from snowballs."

3
00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:16.314
Bird laughed. "You two are silly!"

4
00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:19.283
Squirrel and Kip weren't listening.

5
00:00:19.284 --> 00:00:25.753
They got more snow.

6
00:00:25.754 --> 00:00:29.658
They piled it on top of the wall.

7
00:00:29.659 --> 00:00:34.129
Soon the wall was very tall.

8
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:38.056
"We're safe from snowballs now," said Kip.

9
00:00:38.057 --> 00:00:40.887
The wind blew.

10
00:00:40.888 --> 00:00:47.878
More snow fell on Kip and Squirrel.

11
00:00:47.879 --> 00:00:52.291
"The wall needs to be taller!" cried Squirrel.

12
00:00:52.292 --> 00:00:57.708
Kip and Squirrel got more snow.

13
00:00:57.709 --> 00:01:01.250
But the wind blew again.

14
00:01:01.251 --> 00:01:04.772
"Another snowball hit me!" cried Kip.

15
00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.431
"Me too!" cried Squirrel.

16
00:01:07.432 --> 00:01:12.336
Bird sighed.

17
00:01:12.337 --> 00:01:15.233
She flew up to the snowy branches.

18
00:01:15.234 --> 00:01:19.913
Bird shook a branch and . . . Whoomp!

19
00:01:19.914 --> 00:01:23.494
More snow fell on Kip and Squirrel.

20
00:01:23.495 --> 00:01:25.593
Kip and Squirrel looked up.

21
00:01:25.594 --> 00:01:27.350
They saw Bird.

22
00:01:27.351 --> 00:01:32.031
They saw the branches.

23
00:01:32.032 --> 00:01:36.995
And everybody laughed.

